      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what happened at the end there? The text just completely broke down into a list of random words and gibberish. That’s not usable at all for the game.\n\nI know I asked for more length to help with the depth_score, but it looks like the model just went into a total meltdown to try and inflate the word count. We need actual, coherent narrative content. \n\nCan you try that again? Please, focus on the lore about the Void-Glass and the history of the Hollows. Try to make it long and substantial like we discussed, but please keep it grounded in the world—no more random word salads or broken strings of text. It has to be readable dialogue.",
